category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libargp-devel libcurl-devel libssl-devel libzstd-devel
sdesc: "File format designed for highly efficient deltas while maintaining good compression (utilities)"
ldesc: "zchunk is a compressed file format that splits the file into independent
chunks. This allows you to only download changed chunks when downloading a new
version of the file, and also makes zchunk files efficient over rsync."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/zchunk/zchunk
license: BSD-2-Clause
